cientifically validates GFAP reduction and Ionis=E2=80=99s independent-launch=
 model. (<a href=3D"https://www.fda.gov/news-events/press-announcements/fda-a=
pproves-first-drug-treat-alexander-disease" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decor=
ation:underline;">fda.gov</a>)</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>Voluntary MFN agreements are b=
