urers-to-lower-drug-prices-for-americans/" style=3D"color:#1a5e9a;text-decora=
tion:underline;">whitehouse.gov</a>)</li>
<li style=3D"font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-hei=
ght:1.5;color:#1f2933;margin:0 0 6px;"><strong>Medtronic=E2=80=99s earnings a=
ltered the robotics thesis more than the financial beat did.</strong> The com=
pany paired strong cardiac-ablation growth with a new Cornerstone Robotics pa=
rtnership and FDA clearance of its next-generation Touch Surgery Aide platfor=
m. Its 13.7% quarterly organic growth should not be extrapolated=E2=80=94the =
